        <mxCell id="nt3" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FBFBF4;strokeColor=#A8A8A8;fontSize=10;fontColor=#3D3D3D;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" value="BR-09.4  New SaaS not yet in the catalog always goes through the Spending Approver,&lt;br&gt;even free plans. Budget snapshot, asking Finance,&lt;br&gt;and the commitment only apply when there is a cost (FR-3.14, FR-5.8).&lt;br&gt;WF-09 reuses this decision — no second spend approval;&lt;br&gt;Finance records it in WF-09 (a9)" vertex="1">
