        <mxCell id="nt3" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FBFBF4;strokeColor=#A8A8A8;fontSize=10;fontColor=#3D3D3D;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" value="BR-27.4 · FR-3.13 · FR-3.14  Renew, reduce, or cancel belongs to the Spending Approver,&lt;br&gt;who decides on the budget snapshot; asking Finance is optional,&lt;br&gt;the SLA does not pause. Finance records the budget after the decision.&lt;br&gt;The spend-approval step has an SLA; overdue still goes to the incident branch" vertex="1">
